<title>ITALY: CYCLING-MILAN-TURIN RACE RESULT.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-MILAN-TURIN RACE RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN, Italy 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in the</p>
<p>206-km Milan-Turin cycle race on Wednesday (Italian unless</p>
<p>stated):</p>
<p>1. Daniele Nardelli four hours 43 minutes 37 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Stefano Zanini		   3 seconds behind</p>
<p>3. Laurent Jalabert (France)</p>
<p>4. Richard Virenque (France)</p>
<p>5. Francesco Casagrande</p>
<p>6. Michele Bartoli</p>
<p>7. Massimo Apollonio</p>
<p>8. Andrea Peron</p>
<p>9. Valentino Fois</p>
<p>10. Fabian Jeker (Switzerland)  all same time as Zanini</p>
</text>
